<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Us | A Legacy of Trust &amp; Timeless Elegance - Rahul Jewellers</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Discover Rahul Jewellers Legacy. Crafting heirloom purity, royal polki, certified diamonds, and hallmarked gold since 1989 in Lucknow.">

  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/favicon.png">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/assets/favicon.png">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Top Announcement Bar -->
  <%- include('partials/top-bar') %>

  <!-- Main Navigation Header -->
  <%- include('partials/header', { activePage: 'about' }) %>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <div class="breadcrumb-wrap">
    <div class="breadcrumb-container">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">&gt;</span>
      <span class="current">About us</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main>
    <!-- Top Introduction Banner -->
    <section class="about-intro-section">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <div class="gold-subtitle">A LEGACY OF TRUST, CRAFTSMANSHIP &amp; TIMELESS ELEGANCE</div>
      <p class="intro-paragraph">
        Welcome to Rahul Jewellers, where timeless craftsmanship meets contemporary elegance. For us, jewellery is more than a precious possession &mdash; it is a celebration of love, tradition, milestones, and the moments that become part of your story. Every piece we offer is thoughtfully selected and crafted with an uncompromising focus on quality, authenticity, and attention to detail. From everyday elegance to jewellery created for life's most important occasions, we believe every customer deserves something that feels truly special.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Two-Column Story Grids matching uploaded design -->
    <section class="about-features-container">
      <!-- Story Row 1: Text Left, Image Right -->
      <div class="about-row">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Jewellery That Becomes Part of Your Story</h2>
          <p>
            At Rahul Jewellers, we believe that purchasing exquisite jewellery should be as exceptional as the pieces themselves. Our dedicated team is here to simplify your journey, from explaining the purity and craftsmanship of each item to helping you choose the perfect design that fits your occasion and budget. We stand by our core values of authenticity, quality, transparency, and service, ensuring that you feel confident and satisfied with your investment in something truly special.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-media">
          <img src="/assets/about/about_necklace.jpg" alt="Heritage Diamond and Emerald Necklace on rust silk" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story Row 2: Image Left, Text Right -->
      <div class="about-row">
        <div class="about-media">
          <img src="/assets/about/about_rings.jpg" alt="Three artisan diamond rings worn with elegance" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Crafted With Care. Chosen With Confidence.</h2>
          <p>
            At Rahul Jewellers, we believe that purchasing exquisite jewellery should be as exceptional as the pieces themselves. Our dedicated team is here to simplify your journey, from explaining the purity and craftsmanship of each item to helping you choose the perfect design that fits your occasion and budget. We stand by our core values of authenticity, quality, transparency, and service, ensuring that you feel confident and satisfied with your investment in something truly special.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Journey Section -->
    <section class="about-journey-section">
      <h2>Our Journey</h2>
      <div class="gold-subtitle">BUILT ON TRUST. GROWING WITH GENERATIONS.</div>
      <p class="journey-paragraph">
        Welcome to Rahul Jewellers, where timeless craftsmanship meets contemporary elegance. For us, jewellery is more than a precious possession &mdash; it is a celebration of love, tradition, milestones, and the moments that become part of your story. Every piece we offer is thoughtfully selected and crafted with an uncompromising focus on quality, authenticity, and attention to detail. From everyday elegance to jewellery created for life's most important occasions, we believe every customer deserves something that feels truly special.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Line-Art Palace Footer -->
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="/js/header.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
